  "body": "Currently my spec window looks like this (Firefox 84):\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20210304_135723](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16312324/109967326-2e3e6f80-7ce9-11eb-80c7-750208e4adfd.png)\r\n\r\nFor some reason the bottom bar didn't move back down, after closing the devtools. A similar issue can be experienced, when setting the zoom level to 90% and zooming back in. This may be a firefox issue, but it does not happen with the old spec.\r\n\r\nThis is a screenshot from changing zoom levels:\r\n\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16312324/109967538-752c6500-7ce9-11eb-901a-bb8651d40f3e.png)\r\n\r\n(Notice the bottom right corner not ligning up with the bottom anymore)",
